{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03150","headline":"登乐游原春望书怀 · 张九龄","name":"登乐游原春望书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城隅有乐游，表里见皇州。\n策马既长远，云山亦悠悠。\n万壑清光满，千门喜气浮。\n花间直城路，草际曲江流。\n凭眺兹爲美，离居方独愁。\n已惊玄发换，空度绿荑柔。\n奋翼笼中鸟，归心海上鸥。\n既伤日月逝，且欲桑榆收。\n豹变焉能及，莺鸣非可求。\n愿言从所好，初服返林丘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03150.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03150","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}